#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:1
msgid "E4220"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `regex_match_binding_not_supported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:5
msgid "A lexical case uses a binding that is not available in its matching mode."
msgstr "词法分支使用了当前匹配模式不支持的绑定。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:7
msgid ""
"For `String` and `StringView` inputs, first-match `lexmatch` supports "
"both `before=` and `after=`. Longest-match mode starts at the beginning "
"of the input, so it supports `after=` but not `before=`. Streaming "
"`lexscan` consumes its input buffer and does not expose unmatched "
"prefixes or suffixes through these bindings."
msgstr "对于 `String` 和 `StringView` 输入，首次匹配的 `lexmatch` 同时支持 `before=` 和 `after=`。最长匹配模式从输入开头开始，因此支持 `after=`，但不支持 `before=`。流式 `lexscan` 会消费输入缓冲区，不会通过这些绑定暴露未匹配的前缀或后缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:13
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn first_word(input : String) -> StringView {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word, before=_) => word\n"
"    _ => \"\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:19
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:21
msgid ""
"Remove `before=`, anchor the regex at `^`, and use `after=` when the "
"unmatched suffix is needed."
msgstr "移除 `before=`，用 `^` 锚定正则开头；需要未匹配的后缀时使用 `after=`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4220.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn first_word(input : String) -> StringView {\n"
"  lexmatch input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word, after=_) => word\n"
"    _ => \"\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
